{
  "item": "Vepar01",
  "mu_name": "Vepar",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain _enum.h MONSTER_VEPAR (46), drawn as MONSTER_MODEL_VEPAR = 34 (_enum.h:4184), so OpenMonsterModel loads Monster35.bmd. OpenMU Version075 Maps/Atlans.cs:437-438 names breed 46 'Vepar'. docs/atlans-port.md Part B 4.",
  "world": "atlans",
  "object_type": 46,
  "monster": {
    "model_index": 34,
    "scale": 1.0
  },
  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13807-13811, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_VEPAR: OpenMonsterModel(MONSTER_MODEL_VEPAR); CreateCharacter(Key, MODEL_VEPAR, ...); Scale = 1.0f. No weapon; its link bones are 30 and 39 (:12000-12003), where RenderCharacter hangs a lightning, a spark and a shiny sprite each, always (:11220-11227). It casts Energy Ball (OpenMU Atlans.cs:446), and its attack lets SOUND_EVIL go with two blurred joints off each hand to the target (:2183-2201), as the Devil's.",
  "profile": "monster",
  "rig_from": "Seven actions, exported with --actions=all. 41 bones. MONSTER_MODEL_VEPAR plays both attacks at 0.5 and sets BoneHead 20 (ZzzOpenData.cpp:3644-3652).",
  "sheets": {
    "hp00": "vepar_hp00.png",
    "hp01": "vepar_hp01.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Two sheets out of Data/Monster beside the model, decoded under a vepar_ prefix: hp00.OZJ (128x256, the body, 490 triangles) -- a merman, blue-skinned torso with a steel breastplate patch, black-gloved arms, a green scaled tail ringed with bronze bands, dark fin-hair; hp01.OZT (128x128, 72) -- his fins, gold and green rays on a soft membrane, its own alpha a real mask.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "hp00": "skin",
    "hp01": "leather"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "The body skin to begin with, the tail's scales and the plate judged per island once islands.py has listed them; the fins a membrane (leather), blended as the Bahamut's.",
  "soft_alpha": [
    "leather"
  ],
  "soft_alpha_from": "hp01.OZT is drawn by MU tested and blended (EnableAlphaTest, ZzzOpenglUtil.cpp:366-393), as the Bahamut's fins: the membrane seen through, the rays solid.",
  "sounds_from": "ZzzOpenData.cpp:3644-3652: SetMonsterSound(..., 132, 133, 104, 104, 133), offsets from SOUND_MONSTER_BULL1 = 210 -- 342 BEPAR1 (mBepar1.wav) and 343 BEPAR2 (mBepar2.wav) to move, 343 to die, 314 to attack and flinch. 314 is SOUND_MONSTER_GOLEMDIE, which only the Golem's model loads, so in Atlans MuMain's Vepar swings to SOUND_EVIL alone (:2183-2188); the arm loads mBalrog1.wav, which no slot names. mBalrog1 is used for the flinch, sEvil for the attack. Wired as vepar_* in sounds.json.",
  "islands_from": "17 islands for 562 triangles. Islands 0-2 are hp00, the body (490): one island over the torso, the plate and the scaled tail, so it takes the torso's skin. 3-16 are hp01, his fins (72), leather and blended (soft_alpha). They arrived as skin, the monster profile's default.",
